      "loadduration": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Load versus inference duration",
            "description": "MEANING\nLeft axis: mean duration of completed inference streams, including provider response time. Right axis: achieved dispatch rate. Compare with the configured 10\u2013120 second response schedule; this is not proxy overhead.\n\nTIME WINDOW\nMeasurements over the selected time window; gaps mean no matching samples."
